{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50375","headline":"南安夕阳山真寂寺题诗 · 宣宗皇帝李忱","name":"南安夕阳山真寂寺题诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惟爱禅林秋月空，谁能归去宿龙宫。\n夜深闻法餐甘露，喜在莲花法界中。\n（见明檇李陈懋仁撰《泉南杂志》卷上。\n）（按陈懋仁，字无功，所着《泉南杂志》录唐人诗若干首，谓「《万首唐人绝句》中於吾郡及泉州有未收者，余录其诗於左。\n如此备补遗。\n」又原诗题注曰：「居邸时遁於此」，盖谓李忱曾遁居真寂寺也。\n又诗末注曰：「见《泉州府志》」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宣宗皇帝李忱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50375.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50375","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}